{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57224","headline":"谶 十三 · 菩提达摩","name":"谶 十三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"本是大虫勇，（印宗法师本是小乘，喻如大虫，不是师子）回（《天圣广灯录》作「翻」）成师子谈。\n（回者，传也。\n回小作大，印宗法师礼六祖便悟上乘，是成师子吼）官家封马岭，（封者，印也。\n马岭者，宗也。\n印宗曾爲讲经法师也）同详三十三。\n（同详者，同学也。\n六祖弟子祥岑等三十三人，祥禅师住於峡山）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"菩提达摩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57224.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57224","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}